{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Untitled Discourses on Greed","html":"<article id='an8.121-147'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Aṅguttara Nikāya 8 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Numbered Discourses 8.121–147 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>11. Rāgapeyyāla </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>11. Abbreviated Texts Beginning With Greed </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>~ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Untitled Discourses on Greed </span></h1></header>\n<p><span class='root'>“Rāgassa, bhikkhave, pariññāya …pe… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“For the complete understanding of greed … </span>\n<span class='root'>parikkhayāya … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>complete ending … </span>\n<span class='root'>pahānāya … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>giving up … </span>\n<span class='root'>khayāya … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>ending … </span>\n<span class='root'>vayāya … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>vanishing … </span>\n<span class='root'>virāgāya … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>fading away … </span>\n<span class='root'>nirodhāya … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>cessation … </span>\n<span class='root'>cāgāya … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>giving away … </span>\n<span class='root'>paṭinissaggāya …pe… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>letting go … </span>\n<span class='root'>ime aṭṭha dhammā bhāvetabbā”. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>these eight things should be developed.” </span></p></article>"}
